  "vibe": "Crumb cream (#f4e7cf) with a crust brown (#a9642c), rye and a wheat gold. Bitter sets sturdy slab-serif headlines over Mulish. The world proves in real time: a loaf dome in the lower right actually GROWS with scene progress — its height driven by the beat's own timeline, not a loop — breathing gently on top of that, with scoring slashes cut across the crust and a shadow pooling under it. Its mechanics are a fill bar, a feed, checkboxes and a rolling word. Best for bakeries and food producers, farm and provenance stories, and any brand whose product takes time on purpose.",
